# mark of UTF-16 XMP metadata isn't to begin with; what holds content and
# what content is made of, its operators that open and close what it
# checks, those that name resources, and a byte PDFium reads as white-space;
# and what fonts and color spaces are made of, the keys and names their
# reads and the model's functions of Latin characters and colorants look
# for.
